  "rationale": "Provenance only, re-recorded once from the merged tree. No rule changed and no metric moved for any run this sweep executes. contentRevision moved to 162f80bf169296d0e5fd516cc3c5257a because the founding-grant budget added three god constants (founding-grant-budget-start, founding-grant-accrual-nodes, founding-grant-budget-cap) on top of the five this branch merged from main, and the gate is right that a delta across two content revisions is a category error. These numbers are a measurement and not a balance claim: release-plan.md forbids any balance claim before 0.5.0. The universe remains degenerate in known ways, and one of them is now measured rather than suspected: no strategy in the pool submits god action 8 even at an unbounded budget, so the founding-grant budget this revision adds cannot reach any metric here, and these deltas are exactly zero for a reason rather than reassuringly. This is the regenerate-once-from-the-merged-tree pattern of d5a3357, 6180b65 and d1d3140.",
